<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108477" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποκάθ-ημαι</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποκαθ-κάτημαι</span></b> , prop.
		pf. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποκαθέζομαι,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be seated down in</i> a
			place, <i>station oneself</i> there, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν ταύτῃ τῇ πόλι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					7.27
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>sit below,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>VA</u>
				3.16
			</span></i>; <i>to be placed under,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄμμα ὑ. τῇ ὀφρύϊ</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>lie in ambush,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Str.
				15.1.42
			</span></i>: metaph., <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>VA</u>
				7.14
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποκαθήμενον ὁρᾶν</span> to
			have an <i>insidious</i> look, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Im.</u>
				2.18
			</span></i>; but also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ -καθημένη
			ἀοριστία</span> the <i>fundamental</i> indeterminacy, <i><span class="en">
				Carneisc.
				<u>Herc.</u>
				1027.14
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. acc.
			pers., <i>lie in wait for,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν βάρβαρον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					8.40
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>VS</u>
				2.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Her.</u>
				2.11
			</span></i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φθόνος ὑ. τινά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>VS</u>
					2.26.3
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i>lurk,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.556b
			</span></i>: c. dat., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποκαθημένης αὐτῷ τῆς ὀργῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					4.29.7
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>sit idle,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				11.37
			</span></i>.</div>
